- The RPC `append!` and `next` transition algebras remain exhaustive.
- `:ws/closed`, `:ws/ended`, `:ws/not-found`, and `:ws/transport-error` already conservatively lose outstanding requests.
- The single `repl-step` state owner, cursor advancement, malformed-response consumption, rebind behavior, and monotonic safe-integer allocation remain sound.
